  "title": "Chesapeake Utilities to Host its Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call and Webcast on August 7, 2026",
  "summary": "DOVER, Del. – Chesapeake Utilities Corporation (NYSE: CPK) will host a conference call on Friday, August 7, 2026 at 8:30 a.m. ET to discuss the Company’s financial results for the second quarter ended June 30, 2026. The earnings press release will be issued on Thursday, August 6, 2026, after market close. To listen to [...] The post Chesapeake Utilities to Host its Second Quarter 2026 Earnings Conference Call and Webcast on August 7, 2026 appeared first on Chesapeake Utilities Corporation .",
